If multiple types use the same set of fields, this helps to define those fields as a fragment and slice those fields in other types such as the following:

```exo
@postgres
module TodoDatabase {
  @access(true)
  type Todo {
    @pk id: Int = autoIncrement()
    ...TodoFragment
  }

  fragment TodoFragment {
    completed: Boolean
    title: String
  }
}
```

