Do exponential backoff for failed requests with HTTP 429.
4 retries are set, meaning the timeline for the requests is:
- Original request at t = 0;
- Retry nr. 1 at t = 1s;
- Retry nr. 2 at t = 2s;
- Retry nr. 3 at t = 4s;
- Retry nr. 4 at t = 8s;


