## General changes

- Create TransactionClient to make requests to the Order API
   - Add functions to: 
     - Get Order by ID;
     - Process Order by ID;
     - Capture Order;
     - Cancel Order;
     - Refund Order and Transaction;
     - Create Transaction;
     - Update Transaction;
     - Delete Transaction.
- Add examples of get, process, capture, refund, create, update and delete transaction an Order with full and minimum required fields
- Add integration tests

